WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.085
"Waldo!" Ben cried. "Look out!"

2
00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:24.099
"Huh?" Waldo saw the egg coming and managed to duck in the nick of time.

3
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.232
Ben didn't move, expecting the egg to pass right through him.

4
00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:30.097
But—splat!

5
00:00:30.098 --> 00:00:36.496
The dodo egg hit Ben in the chest, and gooey green dodo yolk splattered all over him.

6
00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:39.338
"Ugh." Ben looked down at his shirt.

7
00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:43.114
"What a mess. Why didn't the egg go right through me?"

8
00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:45.872
Loud laughter suddenly rang out.

9
00:00:45.873 --> 00:00:52.306
A few of the monsters from Team Orange had come into the gym.

10
00:00:52.307 --> 00:00:58.447
"Nice catch, ghost boy!" Carly called. Carly was a doppelganger.

11
00:00:58.448 --> 00:01:06.540
A witch named Brunhilda was cackling with delight.

12
00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:09.627
"You've got egg on your face, Ben!"

13
00:01:09.628 --> 00:01:11.603
Winnie hurried over to him.

14
00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:18.760
"Are you all right?" She held a hand over her mouth, as if she was trying hard not to laugh too.

15
00:01:18.761 --> 00:01:23.513
"I'm fine." Ben wiped egg off his shirt.

16
00:01:23.514 --> 00:01:26.301
"Sorry about that, Ben," Waldo said.

17
00:01:26.302 --> 00:01:29.450
"I tried to cast a spell to stop the egg, but—"

18
00:01:29.451 --> 00:01:34.677
Mog frowned. "No magic during Field Day events, Waldo.

19
00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:37.543
So you can't use it during practice, either."

20
00:01:37.544 --> 00:01:40.792
Waldo nodded. "Right!"

21
00:01:40.793 --> 00:01:43.933
Zork and his teammates were still laughing.

22
00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:47.047
"No offense, Team Black," Zork said.

23
00:01:47.048 --> 00:01:53.651
"But if that's the best you can do, Team Orange is headed for an easy victory."

24
00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:58.538
"Maybe you guys should just sit in the stands and . . ." Carly made her eyes pop out.

25
00:01:58.539 --> 00:02:02.372
"Watch the events instead of competing in them."

26
00:02:02.373 --> 00:02:07.146
Deb, who was the only doppelganger on Mog's team, shot back.

27
00:02:07.147 --> 00:02:09.888
"Well, watch out, Team Orange.

28
00:02:09.889 --> 00:02:12.642
Because tomorrow we're going to bury you!"

29
00:02:12.643 --> 00:02:18.634
She changed into a big tombstone that read RIP Team Orange.

30
00:02:18.635 --> 00:02:27.673
The two doppelgangers kept dueling while everyone in the gym watched.

31
00:02:27.674 --> 00:02:30.746
Carly turned into a giant worm.

32
00:02:30.747 --> 00:02:35.501
"You're the ones who will be sleeping with the worms when we're through with you!"

33
00:02:35.502 --> 00:02:39.769
"Even a worm could outrun you slugs."

34
00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:47.801
Deb became a giant slug and slithered around the gym, leaving a trail of slime.

35
00:02:47.802 --> 00:02:50.933
Serena turned to Winnie.

36
00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:54.136
"This is getting boring," she murmured.

37
00:02:54.137 --> 00:03:03.047
"Let's go." Heads turned to watch walk toward the exit.

38
00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:06.597
Winnie rushed after her.

39
00:03:06.598 --> 00:03:10.308
Zork stepped into the middle of the gym.

40
00:03:10.309 --> 00:03:13.748
"Huddle up, Team Orange," he called.

41
00:03:13.749 --> 00:03:19.546
"Let's show these Team Black losers how a real team practices."

42
00:03:19.547 --> 00:03:26.587
Carly and Brunhilda joined him, along with Cleo and a werewolf named Lon.

43
00:03:26.588 --> 00:03:32.141
Ben quickly counted the competitors.

44
00:03:32.142 --> 00:03:35.645
"That's only five monsters," he thought.

45
00:03:35.646 --> 00:03:38.948
"I wonder who the sixth member of their team is."

46
00:03:38.949 --> 00:03:43.861
Mog scowled. "That's enough practice for now, Team Black.

47
00:03:43.862 --> 00:03:45.129
Let's get out of here.

48
00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.869
We don't want to give these jokers any tips for winning."

49
00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.649
They headed for the exit too.

50
00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:56.428
"Don't drop any more eggs on your way out!" Carly called after them.

51
00:03:56.429 --> 00:04:00.166
"Yeah," Lon said. "You guys already stink!"

52
00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:09.955
Zork laughed. "I'm looking forward to seeing you tomorrow—especially at our first event, the tug-of-war.

53
00:04:09.956 --> 00:04:17.892
That's when you'll get a look at our secret weapon!"

54
00:04:17.893 --> 00:04:33.180
Mog gulped and looked at Ben. "Did he just say secret weapon?"

55
00:04:33.181 --> 00:04:38.118
The next morning Ben found his teammates on the field behind the school.

56
00:04:38.119 --> 00:04:42.167
They were all dressed in black.

57
00:04:42.168 --> 00:04:47.162
"Welcome to Field Day!" Mr. Freaky called.

58
00:04:47.163 --> 00:04:53.349
Like the teachers, he was dressed in orange and black so he could root for both teams.

59
00:04:53.350 --> 00:05:02.229
The cheerleaders waved their pom-poms. "Go, Orange! Go, Black!" they cheered.

60
00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:06.221
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle.

61
00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:09.730
"Okay, monsters, here's how Field Day works.

62
00:05:09.731 --> 00:05:21.089
We've got four events today—the tug-of-war, the sack race, the slime ball toss, and finally, the cross-country race.

63
00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:26.910
The team that wins the most events will be crowned Field Day champions."

64
00:05:26.911 --> 00:05:31.818
"Woo-hoo! That's going to be us!" Zork shouted.

65
00:05:31.819 --> 00:05:37.911
"Mr. Gwarg?" Francis hopped up and down, trying to get the gym teacher's attention.

66
00:05:37.912 --> 00:05:43.560
Finally the gym teacher saw him. "Yes, Francis?"

67
00:05:43.561 --> 00:05:47.853
"What happens if there's a tie?" Francis asked.

68
00:05:47.854 --> 00:05:52.438
"Huh." Mr. Gwarg tapped a finger against his chin.

69
00:05:52.439 --> 00:05:55.140
"I never thought about that before."

70
00:05:55.141 --> 00:05:59.316
He was quiet for a few seconds.

71
00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:10.113
"Well, how about this: If there's a tie, the team with the second-place winner in the cross-country race will win."

72
00:06:10.114 --> 00:06:13.213
A zombie wiped drool from his chin.

73
00:06:13.214 --> 00:06:17.495
"That doesn't make much sense," he said.

74
00:06:17.496 --> 00:06:21.270
He looked around at some other monsters.

75
00:06:21.271 --> 00:06:27.152
"Or does it?" Another bit of drool dripped from his mouth.

76
00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:30.259
"It doesn't matter if it makes sense!" Lon said.

77
00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:39.019
"Because Team Orange is going to win every single event!" He howled loudly.

78
00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:43.600
Deb narrowed her eyes. "No way, hairball!"

79
00:06:43.601 --> 00:06:54.350
Monsters booed and cheered again.

80
00:06:54.351 --> 00:06:59.190
They were so loud that some monsters held their hands over their ears.

81
00:06:59.191 --> 00:07:05.542
A monster with four ears but only two hands tried desperately to cover her ears.

82
00:07:05.543 --> 00:07:17.320
Ben sighed. Field Day hadn't even started yet, and he already felt exhausted.
